            <p style="font:600 14px/1.5 Inter;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);margin:0 0 12px;"><strong>Outcome:</strong> Two things happen in parallel — your existing customers lock in as weekly repeat buyers, and new buyers find you for the first time. Your data tells you what to stock, when to open, which fish to push. You know your business better than anyone.</p>

